{
  "esm": "1.2.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "MosaicMesaSaltRates",
    "description": "The rate and residual of MOSAIC's MESA solid-liquid equilibrium (WRF v4.8.0 chem/module_mosaic_therm.F, mesa_ptc / mesa_flux_salt) at a given solid state E_s, for one size bin, assembled from its parts: the state's liquid by mass balance (mesa_salt_equilibrium.esm `a_l_state`, totals less the solid's ions) goes through ions_to_electrolytes.esm (I2E: the liquid electrolytes, insoluble CaSO4 to the solid), aerosol_water_zsr.esm (Zsr: the ZSR water at the bin's water activity) and mtem_activities.esm (Act: the MTEM activities), and mesa_salt_equilibrium.esm (Eq) returns each salt's saturation ratio S_s, the pseudo-time rate dE_s/dtau = S_s - 1 (with its switch-offs) and the scaled residual phi. This is the whole right-hand side of the relaxation whose steady state is the equilibrium, as a function of E_s and the bin's fixed inputs: an EarthSciIntegrator `solve` node (pseudo-transient continuation, or Newton on the active-set residual, with E_s >= 0) solves it. mesa_ptc's own iteration -- explicit Euler with a per-salt adaptive step, its 1% stopping test and its 80-pass cap -- is solver and is not written here (CLAUDE.md; mesa_salt_equilibrium.esm says what was removed). MesaRates only re-exposes ions_to_electrolytes' liquid species one by one because compute_activities takes them as scalars.\n\nTESTS: states mesa_ptc visited, from the MESA tape (WRF fork module_esm_mesa_tape, kernels/mosaic_therm_driver; data/eqwefic/chem170_scm/mesa64), real64: inputs are the TOP record's solid (the pass's starting state), the ENTRY record (totals, temperature, water activity) and the bin's MTEM inputs (GAMZ record, keq_ll); expected are the mass balance against the TOP record's liquid, the THERM record's water and activities, and the FLUX record's S, phi and rate (a salt mesa_dissolve_small_salt snapped on that pass is asserted at the taped S - 1, since the snap is solver). rel 1e-9, amounts with an absolute floor of 1e-12 of the bin's largest total amount, flags exactly. The assembly closes no loop: the state is an input, so this is one evaluation of the right-hand side, not a solve. Twelve further tests sit at CONVERGED states (mesa_ptc rerun to rtol 1e-10, mesa64/tight): there the rate is zero for every salt and g, the residual a bounded solve is given, is zero where solid is present and the non-positive S - 1 where none is, at an absolute 2e-10. The same assembly with E_s as algebraic unknowns is couplings/mosaic_mesa_equilibrium.esm, which has no tests because the Rust CLI does not evaluate implicit equations.",
    "authors": [
      "EqWeFiC"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Zaveri, R.A., Easter, R.C., Peters, L.K. (2005). A computationally efficient Multicomponent Equilibrium Solver for Aerosols (MESA). J. Geophys. Res. 110, D24203."
      },
      {
        "citation": "WRF v4.8.0 chem/module_mosaic_therm.F"
      }
    ]
  },
  "metaparameters": {
    "NEL": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 22,
      "description": "MOSAIC electrolytes."
    },
    "NAER": {
      "type": "integer",
      "default": 112,
      "description": "MOSAIC aerosol species per bin (chem_opt = 170)."
    }
  },
  "index_sets": {
    "el": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NEL"
    },
    "solv": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NEL"
    },
    "aer": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": "NAER"
    },
    "salt": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": 15
    },
    "sp": {
      "kind": "interval",
      "size": 7
    }
  },
  "models": {
    "I2E": {
      "ref": "../components/aerosol/mosaic/ions_to_electrolytes.esm"
    },
    "Zsr": {
      "ref": "../components/aerosol/mosaic/aerosol_water_zsr.esm"
    },
    "Act": {
      "ref": "../components/aerosol/mosaic/mtem_activities.esm"
    },
    "Eq": {
      "ref": "../components/aerosol/mosaic/mesa_salt_equilibrium.esm"
    },
    "MesaRates": {
      "variables": {
        "t_k": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "K",
          "default": 298.0,
          "description": "Temperature."
        },
        "a_w": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.8,
          "description": "The bin's water activity ah2o_a (the Kelvin-lowered value aerosol_phase_state passes in), at which compute_activities' ZSR water is taken."
        },
        "aer_t": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "aer"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Total species aer(:, jtotal)."
        },
        "elec_t": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "el"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Total electrolytes."
        },
        "elec_s": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "el"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "THE STATE: the solid electrolytes at which the rates are evaluated, the unknown of the solid-liquid equilibrium (on the tape, a pass's starting solid)."
        },
        "log_gamz": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "el",
            "solv"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "MTEM binary log10 activity coefficients at the cell's relative humidity (mtem_binary_log_gamma.esm; mtem_compute_log_gamz runs once per MOSAIC call, at ah2o, not ah2o_a)."
        },
        "keq_hso4": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "mol/kg",
          "default": 0.01,
          "description": "Keq_ll(1) at the cell temperature."
        },
        "k_w": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "mol^2/kg^2",
          "default": 1e-14,
          "description": "Keq_ll(3), water's ion product."
        },
        "a_liq": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "shape": [
            "sp"
          ],
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "The liquid species as ions_to_electrolytes leaves them (coupled from I2E.a)."
        },
        "so4": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "description": "Liquid sulfate handed to compute_activities."
        },
        "no3": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "description": "Liquid nitrate."
        },
        "cl": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "description": "Liquid chloride."
        },
        "nh4": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "description": "Liquid ammonium."
        },
        "msa": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "description": "Liquid MSA."
        },
        "na": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "description": "Liquid sodium."
        },
        "ca": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "nmol/m^3",
          "description": "Liquid calcium."
        }
      },
      "equations": [
        {
          "lhs": "so4",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "index",
            "args": [
              "a_liq",
              1
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "no3",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "index",
            "args": [
              "a_liq",
              2
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "cl",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "index",
            "args": [
              "a_liq",
              3
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "nh4",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "index",
            "args": [
              "a_liq",
              4
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "msa",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "index",
            "args": [
              "a_liq",
              5
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "na",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "index",
            "args": [
              "a_liq",
              6
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "ca",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "index",
            "args": [
              "a_liq",
