      "tests": [
        {
          "id": "hand_nh4no3_nacl70_c1_it1",
          "description": "Covers: all_liquid_1, all_solid_0, undersat_no_solid. Source: hand-specified bin 'nh4no3_nacl70' (sulfate-free NH4NO3 + NaCl (X_T = -1): the sodium/nitrate/chloride salts; chem170_scm/mesa64/make_mesa_hand.py), mesa_ptc call 1, pass 1. The rate and residual of the solid-liquid equilibrium at the state mesa_ptc started this pass from, assembled from that state alone: its solid (TOP record), the bin's totals and water activity (ENTRY), and its MTEM inputs (GAMZ, keq_ll); expected: the liquid by mass balance (TOP), the ZSR water and activities mesa_flux_salt saw (THERM), and S, phi and the rate (FLUX; a salt mesa_dissolve_small_salt snapped is asserted at the taped S - 1). Real64 MESA tape; rel 1e-9, amounts with an absolute floor of 1e-12 of the bin's largest total amount, flags exactly.",
